The bank-code datasets (the generated *.g.dart files in lib/src/data/,
and their sources in data/bank_codes/ in the repository) are NOT covered
by the MIT License. They are derived from the publications listed below,
and their publishers' terms apply. The values kept (bank codes, BICs,
names, addresses) are reproduced as published, but the datasets are not
complete copies of the sources. They have been:
  - converted to JSON: one entry per bank code in data/bank_codes/, and
    a compact form, embedded in the generated Dart files, that lists bank
    codes sharing the same details once;
  - reduced to the fields this package uses (other columns are dropped);
  - filtered to the rows a bank-code-to-BIC lookup needs. For example,
    only the Bundesbank's main records (Merkmal 1) are kept, and rows
    without a BIC are left out.

